    {
      "id": "7e7a0b27bb666d143909f0d245a32698d3784790",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1977007023,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Ok! I now see that after updating my master branch and rebasing I get the same error when running \"make\" as the pipeline does. The issue here is that the code is not mine, I haven't modified the lines of code that are generating the failure.\n\nSo, before I start modifying someone else's code... Can you confirm that it's \"normal\" behavior? That it's possible that errors have nothing to do with my modifications and that they would have occurred regardless?\n\nIf so, I'll take a look and try to fix the issue.",
          "author": {
            "id": 13682248,
            "username": "daniel.ulied",
            "public_email": null,
            "name": "Daniel Ulied Guevara",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/582d02c69af989881fc9d635c24d50aafe21716a80e6e9a1bbabe4bb106dc5ce?s=80&d=identicon",
