          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Just out of curiosity and for future contributions. How can I \"build (make/ninja) in /epan/dissectors/asn1/its\"? \n\nI couldn't do it because of the error mentioned above. I still regenerated the packet-its.c by running the python script directly, which is not ideal...",
