        {
          "id": 1978771164,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "If you go to the root of your build directory,\n\n`ninja generate_dissector-its` will regenerate just the one dissector.\n`ninja asn1` will try to regenerate all of them that haven't been regenerated recently (which may be too many due to modification times on your local box.)\n\nOn my box at least, tab completion actually works with the various build targets with ninja (but not make.)",
