          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "If I am generating a single ASN dissector I will go to the build folder for that dissector:\n\ncd ~/wireshark-build/epan/dissectors/asn1/its\n\nThen build in that folder:\n\nmake\n\n(because I currently don't run cmake with -G ninja)\n\nIf I make a change to asn2wrs.py itself, I will do the make from the folder above (and regenerate all of the asn1 dissectors).",
